    <!-- SECTION 9 -->
    <section id="s9">
      <h2>9. Chain of Custody &amp; Legal Considerations</h2>
      <div class="section-divider"></div>

      <p>
        No matter how technically brilliant the forensic analysis, it is worthless if the <span class="highlight">chain
          of custody</span> is broken. Chain of custody is a documented, unbroken record of who had possession of
        evidence, when, where, and what was done with it.
      </p>

